  "details": "In build 1608, the crash mentioned in the subject occurs.\n\nMany worlds based on the Chikuwa Vehicle System 2 have been broken by the recent update. They were working fine in build 1607.\n\nThe crash happens in GetComponentShim.GetComponentInChildren, but I haven't been able to find a reliable reproduction process yet.\n\nSample worlds affected by the issue:\n\nOi Wharf V2 Remastered［90sGDSP］\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ebcfe714-7fe0-43a6-9282-c87cde22dac5\n\nUraRokkou\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_2a3df68a-86a8-4949-86a3-f4cac379ac0a\n\nFutatsukane Lake Around Pass\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_3f0d78a5-0703-4f8f-be48-f5938a48f986\n\nDodge Stadium\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_2e100a22-b246-4e54-bbd4-35d2b9122f3d\n\nDrift Park S.L.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_06c1e4e8-e9ce-48cc-8095-30aa62cb3fc6",
